title: The timeline of the selected file: a renamed file shows its three commits (through the rename), a file of one commit shows one, a new untracked file shows none, a selected symbol keeps its file's timeline (manual check of the pictures, bottom of the left panel)
folders: git-renamed
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left files
wait 500
goto src/new_name.rs
wait 1500
mark 1-renamed-three-commits
wait 500
goto src/main.rs
wait 1500
mark 2-one-commit
wait 500
goto src/fresh.rs
wait 1500
mark 3-new-file-none
wait 500
select kept
wait 1500
mark 4-symbol-of-renamed
wait 500
goto src
wait 1500
mark 5-folder
wait 500
left changes
goto src/new_name.rs
wait 1500
mark 6-changes-panel
wait 500
quit
